WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.441
Step 1. Open the template panel.

1.2
00:00:02.441 --> 00:00:07.371
You can save all the items of a question at once, or one item at a time.

1.3
00:00:07.371 --> 00:00:12.801
In the Medication Request or Service Request question, select Templates.

2.1
00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:16.499
Step 2. Save the current items. Select Save Current.

2.2
00:00:16.499 --> 00:00:20.013
The button shows the number of items in the question,

2.3
00:00:20.013 --> 00:00:24.027
and Care shows the items that it saves under Preview.

3.1
00:00:24.027 --> 00:00:27.351
Step 3. Remove the items that you do not want.

3.2
00:00:27.351 --> 00:00:30.959
Select the cross icon next to an item to leave it out.

3.3
00:00:30.959 --> 00:00:33.931
The other items stay in the template.

4.1
00:00:33.931 --> 00:00:38.229
Step 4. Fill in the template details. Template Name is required.

4.2
00:00:38.229 --> 00:00:41.138
Select departments to share the template with,

4.3
00:00:41.138 --> 00:00:49.714
or leave Select Department empty to keep the template personal.

5.1
00:00:49.714 --> 00:00:53.599
Step 5. Create the template. Select Create Template.

5.2
00:00:53.599 --> 00:00:59.550
Care shows Template created successfully and returns to the list of templates.

6.1
00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:02.704
Step 6. Add one item to a template instead.

6.2
00:01:02.704 --> 00:01:06.823
Open the actions menu of the item and select Add to template.

6.3
00:01:06.823 --> 00:01:13.782
Adding an item to an existing template removes all its department sharing.
